, when attached, that's [documented](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.html#current-gotchas-and-known-issues), so if that is what makes it not work it's not a bug but a documented requirement","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2944744399/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2944846449","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106937#issuecomment-2944846449","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106937","id":2944846449,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vhspx","user":{"login":"reagan-cheatham","id":210392622,"node_id":"U_kgDODIpWLg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/210392622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reagan-cheatham","html_url":"https://github.com/reagan-cheatham","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reagan-cheatham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reagan-cheatham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reagan-cheatham/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reagan-cheatham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reagan-cheatham/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reagan-cheatham/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reagan-cheatham/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reagan-cheatham/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reagan-cheatham/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T14:43:47Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T14:43:47Z","body":"Hmm well then of course it's a separate issue, but that requirement only ca